    "Candidates are ordered by straight-line proximity. We use one nearby verified access point per water, then calculate actual driving time. Default comparison covers the closest 12; Preferences can expand it to all eligible waters.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Candidates are ordered by straight-line proximity. We use one nearby verified access point per water, then calculate actual driving time. Default comparison covers the closest 12; Preferences can expand it to all eligible waters."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先按直线距离选择候选水域，每个使用一个附近的已核验入口，再计算实际车程。默认比较最近的 12 个，可在偏好中扩大到全部符合条件的水域。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
