          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start at 100. Subtract 1.4 per mph of wind, 0.35 per percentage point of rain, and 1.5 per degree below 45°F or above 80°F. Require at least 65. Exclude darkness, thunder, frozen precipitation, air below 35°F, wind above 22 mph from shore or 15 mph by boat, and rain chances above 80%. These are conservative planning rules, not validated catch or safety predictions.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Start at 100. Subtract 1.4 per mph of wind, 0.35 per percentage point of rain, and 1.5 per degree below 45°F or above 80°F. Require at least 65. Exclude darkness, thunder, frozen precipitation, air below 35°F, wind above 22 mph from shore or 15 mph by boat, and rain chances above 80%. These are conservative planning rules, not validated catch or safety predictions."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "初始分 100。每 1 mph 风速扣 1.4 分，每 1% 降雨概率扣 0.35 分；低于 45°F 或高于 80°F，每度扣 1.5 分。最低要求 65 分。排除夜间、雷暴、冻结降水、低于 35°F、岸钓风速超 22 mph 或船钓超 15 mph、降雨概率超 80% 的时段。这些是保守规划规则，不是经过验证的咬口或安全预测。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
