    "All eligible waters in your selected scope are compared, using one nearby verified access point per water and actual driving time. Radius uses straight-line miles to that access point. Driving limits, species and access preferences still apply.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "All eligible waters in your selected scope are compared, using one nearby verified access point per water and actual driving time. Radius uses straight-line miles to that access point. Driving limits, species and access preferences still apply."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "比较所选范围内全部符合条件的水域，每个水域使用一个附近已核验入口及真实车程。距离按出发点到该入口的直线英里数计算，仍按车程、鱼种和出入方式筛选。"
          }
        }
      }
